  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TB/MH LON Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(USAID Global Health (GH)):  A local partner in Africa will provide expertise, ingenuity, and passion to advance opportunities for developing a regional capacity building framework making an effort to increase knowledge, skills, establish methodology and infrastructure needed to implement and sustain evidence-based, culturally appropriate model(s) for mental health management integrated into tuberculosis service.</narrative>
  </description>
